 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "doubly linked sequence plus a lazy index from adjacent id pair to positions; per token enumerate its splits into two earlier tokens, sort the candidate positions and merge left to right with validity checks. Complexity target: O(n log n + sum of token lengths) time/O(n) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
